jt-pve-storage-dellemc (0.7.98~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use.
  * Added: on PowerStore, the host object the array already has for this node
    is used rather than a second one being created. An initiator can belong
    to only one host object, so when there is no host under the name this
    plugin uses, it looks for one holding this node's initiators and uses
    that, recording the name locally. Nothing is renamed, removed or moved.
    Adopted only when the host's initiators are a subset of this node's - one
    that also carries another host's ports is refused, by name, because a
    volume mapped there would be visible to whatever else is in it. Ports
    split across two host objects are refused as well.

