  * Chinese text now uses full-width punctuation throughout; 219 half-width
    marks had accumulated, and t/11-imports.t fails on them from now on.
  * The 0.7.88 entry wrongly named qm move_disk among the operations it
    fixed; a same-node move goes through qemu-img convert and path(), never
    through the transfer formats. The entry carries the correction.

