jt-pve-storage-dellemc (0.7.91~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use.
  * Fixed: two storages on one array shared an API client, and with it a
    password. The client cache was keyed on management address, username,
    TLS setting and health flag, while the cached object carries the storeid
    it names in every message and the password, which since 0.7.86 is read
