  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use. No storage type has been run
    against physical hardware.
  * Moving a linked clone's disk to a storage of another type would have
    failed. parse_volname returned the whole volname as its name element for
    a linked clone; PVE builds the target volume name out of that element,
    so the target would have been asked for a volume named
