jt-pve-storage-dellemc (0.7.29~beta1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use. No storage type has been run
    against physical hardware.
  * PowerStore: a host that belongs to a host group is now handled. A
    host_volume_mapping made to a group carries host_group_id and no
    host_id, and it occupies a LUN id on every host in the group. Reading
    only host_id called such a volume unmapped and handed out a LUN id that
    was already in use. The mapping check counts a group mapping, the LUN
    search excludes the ids those mappings hold, and an unmap that finds
    only a group mapping says so instead of silently doing nothing.
  * docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md carries the numbers from Dell KB 000199943: ESXi
    scans LUN ids 0-1023, Linux with the Emulex FC driver only 0-255. That
    is why this plugin stops at 255, and a test now pins it there.

