  * BETA RELEASE. Not for production use. No storage type has been run
    against physical hardware.
  * PowerVault would not have come up at all. Two commands on the first
    activation of the storage were guesses, and both were wrong:
      - creating a host is 'create host initiators <list> <name>', not
        'create host id <list> <name>';
